      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Listen, if the lower corners are run by rough hands like a roughneck mechanic named \"T-Rex\" with a jawline that can split a brick, while the polished犯罪的 operate from suit-wearing syndicate types like a slick accountant with too much trust on his face. The contrast needs to show that the street guys wear patched jackets, smell of gas and stale smoke, whereas the organized ones dress sharp and hide their duplicity behind polite hands and expensive watches. To really nail the reality, you need those tenements buzzing with locals who hang on the steps, speaking heavy dialects, but their \"bosses\" in the towers are quiet and seek income not survival. Focusing on the noir style, it deeply needs the contrast between the violence on the pavement and the cold, calculated chaos within the offices.",
